    weapon: "Chem-Haz Capitaine | Gendarmerie Nationale",
    name: "Chem-Haz Capitaine | Gendarmerie Nationale",
    type: "CT Agents",
    rarity: "Superior",
    color: "white",
    art: "CT",
    description: "As leader for Chemical and BioHazard combat operations in populated areas, the Gendarmerie Chem-Haz Capitaine plays a crucial role within the organization. Celebrated for orchestrating the successful rescue of an entire domestic airport's civilian occupancy in the infamous sarin gas attack of 1997, the Chem-Haz Capitaine is the epitome of preparedness and composure.    \\n\\n<i>Don't forget to breathe.</i>",
