    weapon: "Cmdr. Mae 'Dead Cold' Jamison | SWAT",
    name: "Cmdr. Mae 'Dead Cold' Jamison | SWAT",
    type: "CT Agents",
    rarity: "Master",
    color: "red",
    art: "CT",
    description: "Cmdr. 'Dead Cold' Jamison has just about seen it all. Skeptical and wry in the midst of deadly combat, others could mistake her for being nonchalant about the chaos at hand. They would be wrong. Nothing gets past Dead Cold, not bad guys with AK-47s, junior officers that call her 'Ma'am,' or an opportunity to make elite officers smirk under pressure.\\n\\n<i>You're gonna find out.</i>",
