    weapon: "Blackwolf | Sabre",
    name: "Blackwolf | Sabre",
    type: "T Agents",
    rarity: "Superior",
    color: "red",
    art: "T",
    description: "Blackwolf stalks Sabre's enemies with preternatural determination and focus. Raised deep within the bitter forests of Eastern Europe, he can sense human presence with exceptional accuracy\u2014and he knows what to do when he's sensed it. \\n\\n<i>I don't need to see them to kill them.</i>",
