    id: 1034437779,
    weapon: "Dragomir | Sabre",
    name: "Dragomir | Sabre",
    type: "T Agents",
    rarity: "Exceptional",
    color: "white",
    art: "T",
    description: "A man of few words, Dragomir is disturbingly patient. Known for holding position for days at a time, some say he's one of Sabre's best marksman. Others say he's napping. No one really knows. No one left alive, anyway.\\n\\n<i>...I wait.</i>",
