    type: "T Agents",
    rarity: "Superior",
    color: "pink",
    art: "T",
    description: "Weird, quirky, unhinged; a few words that describe The Professionals' safecracker and technical mastermind. When she is not mumbling to herself about the flawed assumptions inherent within the profit maximization paradox, Safecracker serves as a morally questionable but highly efficient 'fundraising expert.' She enjoys short walks on pavement, the sound of cable ties being fastened, and testing explosive prototypes under immense pressure.\\n\\n<i>Don't blow it. DO blow the bomb though, okay? We do want that.</i>",
