    rarity: "Distinguished",
    color: "gold",
    art: "T",
    description: "The experienced and cunning Trapper Aggressors utilize ruthless efficiency in capturing and securing tourists as hostages. As experts in wetland and jungle-based guerrilla tactics, any rescue missions involving Trapper Aggressors are doomed to fail. \\n\\n<i>The promise of air conditioning and iced tea. It works every time.</i>",
    image: "https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/economy/image/i0CoZ81Ui0m-9KwlBY1L_18myuGuq1wfhWSaZgMttyVfPaERSR0Wqmu7LAocGIa-2lmxU-LR0dnuNm6E8Vl45Iv181z1fgn8oZz18yVX6s28aa1pJeKsGGaCyO94pOcnS3u1xEp042mAz9n_IinBPQckCpAkR7UC40TtltKxMu3h4gWLjI9AzzK-0H3_4J31MA",
    minFloat: null,
    maxFloat: null,
